 "description": "Copy of \"anchor: organization\" that sends resource_type when it creates a role or permission. It replaces the original once ADR-0022 PR 1 is deployed. Organization CRUD, names are not unique (a second organization with the same name is created), founding member (atomic, idempotent per user), one not-found code (ORGANIZATION_NOT_FOUND) on GET/PUT/DELETE, refusals, and every organization / founding-membership event checked in one final webhook wait.",
